{"hymn":"SY270","parent":"NS292","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":1},"title":"Aunque el mundo me prometa mas","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":["Aun","i"],"n2":["que‿el","t"],"n3":["mun","i"],"n4":["do","t"],"n5":"me","n7":["pro","i"],"n8":["me‿ta","t"],"n9":"mas,","n11":["So","i"],"n12":["lo","t"],"n13":"me","n14":["lle","i"],"n15":["na","m"],"n16":["ré","t"],"n18":"del","n19":["Se","i"],"n20":["ñor.","t"],"n22":"No","n23":["va","i"],"n24":["le","t"],"n25":"la","n26":["pe","i"],"n28":["na","t"],"n29":["vi","i"],"n30":["vir,","t"],"n32":"Por","n33":"las","n34":["co","i"],"n35":["sas","t"],"n36":"que","n37":"no","n39":["du","i"],"n41":["ra","m"],"n42":["rán.","t"],"n43":"No","n44":["im","i"],"n45":["por","m"],"n46":["ta","t"],"n47":"cuan","n48":["ri","i"],"n50":["co‿o‿e","m"],"n52":["xi","m"],"n53":["to","m"],"n54":["so","t"],"n55":["se","i"],"n56":["ré,","t"],"n57":"¡Oh","n58":["cuan","i"],"n59":["tos","t"],"n60":["pla","i"],"n61":["ce","m"],"n64":["res","t"],"n65":"se","n66":"me‿han","n67":["de‿o","i"],"n68":["fre","m"],"n69":["cer!","t"],"n70":["Na","i"],"n71":["da","t"],"n72":"se","n73":["com","i"],"n75":["pa","m"],"n77":["ra‿a","t"],"n78":"mi","n79":"gran","n80":["por","i"],"n81":["ve","m"],"n82":["nir:","t"],"n83":"Ser","n84":["lle","i"],"n85":["no","t"],"n86":"del","n87":["Se","i"],"n89":["ñor","t"],"n90":["has","i"],"n91":["ta‿el","t"],"n93":"fin."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Y aunque muy pequeño aún soy;","Y el futuro esta‿en frente de mi,","Su llamado en mi corazón;","Me lleva‿a seguir a mi Señor.","Aunque‿el camino tenga‿alegría o dolor,","Lo que más importa‿es ganar del Señor.","No importa que pase, nunca cambiaré.","¡Hecho fui para‿a Dios contener!","(¡Si! Amén! Para‿a Dios contener!)"]}]}